 let panel=document.createElement('section');panel.className='invoiceMediaPanel';
 panel.innerHTML=`<h3>${isPolicy?'Share Policy & All Files':'Share A4 Invoice & All Files'}</h3><p>Customer mobile: <strong>${esc(phone||'Not supplied')}</strong></p><a id="openCustomerWhatsapp" class="btn success" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1">Message Only — Open Customer Chat</a><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="copyInvoiceWhatsAppText">Copy Message</button><p>The invoice PDF is included automatically. Add any extra files, then choose Share Invoice + Message and select WhatsApp. If WhatsApp omits the text, use Copy Message and paste it in the same chat.</p><p>Use Attach from PC / Phone to choose photos, videos or PDFs for temporary sharing. Files selected in Documents & Images for this record are included for this tab only; files are never saved to the record or website.</p>${!isPolicy?'<button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="prepareInvoicePdf">Preview / Print Invoice</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="downloadInvoicePdf" disabled>Download A4 Invoice PDF</button><div id="invoicePdfPreview" class="invoicePdfPreview" aria-live="polite" style="max-height:380px;overflow:auto;margin:12px 0;padding:10px;background:#eef2f7;border:1px solid #dbe2ea"><p>Preparing invoice preview…</p></div>':''}<label class="btn secondary" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer">📎 Attach from PC / Phone<input type="file" id="invoiceMediaFiles" multiple accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,video/mp4,video/webm,video/quicktime" aria-label="Attach files from PC or phone" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0;overflow:hidden"></label><div id="invoiceMediaList"></div>${!isPolicy?'<label><input type="checkbox" id="includeInvoiceImage"> Also include invoice image</label>':''}<p>Up to 10 files, 50 MB per file and 100 MB total. WhatsApp and your device may apply additional limits.</p><button type="button" class="btn success" id="shareInvoiceMedia" disabled>Share ${isPolicy?'Policy + Message':'Invoice + Message'}</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="clearInvoiceMedia">Clear Additional Files</button><p id="invoiceMediaStatus" role="status">Preparing files…</p><p>Open WhatsApp Chat with Customer takes you directly to the saved mobile number. File sharing uses the device share menu and may ask you to choose the recipient again; confirm the number before tapping Send.</p>`;
